    skos:changeNote "Lists provenance and publication info templates besides assertion ones, using the widened query, and shows each row's template type. The list action fills that type into the listing template, which no longer fixes it. The view node moves to <np>/viewVersion following the naming convention; the version-independent IRI is unchanged.";
